WEBVTT

00:09:25.764 --> 00:09:30.751
<i>Yes, there are two paths you
can go by, but in the long run,</i>

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:35.434
<i>There's still time to change
the road you're on</i>

00:09:38.733 --> 00:09:41.344
Vai to tik nevarētu klausīties visu dienu?

00:09:41.368 --> 00:09:42.975
Nu labi, te nu tā ir otrādi,

00:09:42.999 --> 00:09:47.029
pamēģiniet saklausīt slēptos ziņojumus, 
kam tur it kā būtu jābūt. (Mūzika)

00:09:47.513 --> 00:09:54.291
(Mūzika ar nesaprotamiem vārdiem)